rous spirit and draining his ability to enjoy... er... the things that teenage boys normally spend most of their time thinking about! And now that he's been de-debased and de-debauched by her un-dirty trick, the poor regenerated degenerate's only hope of getting his licentiousness renewed is to join the queen of mental-clean on her quest, since when she leaves our mortal plane he regains his normal immorality! But the termination of the probation of his reprobation isn't guaranteed, because the Goddesses of Death can be really a harsh mistresses and it's going to be anything but easy to go back to being sleazy! <br><br>\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":25,"month":9,"year":2012},"episodes":12,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"Crunchyroll","type":"STREAMING","url":"http://www.crunchyroll.com/so-i-cant-play-h"},{"language":null,"site":"Hulu","type":"STREAMING","url":"http://www.hulu.com/so-i-cant-play-h"}],"genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance","Supernatural"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":60,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":31,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":2012},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":23,"season":"SUMMER","type":"RATED","year":2012},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":4,"season":"SUMMER","type":"POPULAR","year":2012}],"relations":[["SOURCE",55597,25597,"MANGA","NOVEL"],["SEQUEL",14893,14893,"ANIME","OVA"],["ALTERNATIVE",55547,25547,"MANGA","MANGA"]],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2012,"source":"LIGHT_NOVEL","startDate":{"day":6,"month":7,"year":2012},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":758,"score":10},{"amount":898,"score":20},{"amount":1652,"score":30},{"amount":2897,"score":40},{"amount":5392,"score":50},{"amount":7907,"score":60},{"amount":8531,"score":70},{"amount":4161,"score":80},{"amount":1919,"score":90},{"amount":1310,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":4520